<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoLexerAdvance</function></refname>
  <refpurpose></refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Lexer.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoLexerAdvance(SilikoLexer *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The `SilikoLexerNext` function advances the `SilikoLexer` object to its
next token.


* `Lexer` is the lexer to advance. If `Lexer` has reached the end of its
  input, further calls to `SilikoLexerNext` on `Lexer` will have no
  effect, and `SilikoLexerGetToken` will return a token indicating the
  end of input has been reached.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para></para>
</refsection>
